bodyglass/synthstrip.py is an independent re-implementation of the SynthStrip network
definition so that the published weights can be loaded:
  Hoopes A, Mora JS, Dalca AV, Fischl B, Hoffmann M. SynthStrip: Skull-Stripping for
  Any Brain Image. NeuroImage 260, 119474 (2022). https://synthstrip.io
No SynthStrip code or weights are included in this repository.

Model weights, Python packages, FastSurfer and TotalSegmentator are not included in this
repository. They are downloaded by install.sh or by the app, each under its own license;
see "Credits and licenses" in README.md.
